{"3366320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Remnant Frontier: Survival", "steam_appid": 3366320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the wealthy elite abandon a climate decimated earth, the remnants of human society focus their last hope  on their newly discovered &quot;<i>Quantum Canon</i>&quot; technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After stockpiling years of energy, they are ready to send a single augmented-human explorer to a seemingly uninhabited, distant living-world dubbed &quot;New Pangea&quot;. They hope that in this new frontier they can build the &quot;<i>Quantum Gate Terminus</i>&quot; that will allow  humanity to flee the dying Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Explorers job is simple: Without Tools or Resources, <strong>Naked</strong> and <strong>Alone</strong> (Except for your helpful ocular mounted AI companion &quot;<i>ALAI</i>&quot;):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> this new world and learn it's secrets and history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> privation and isolation of the eerily familiar planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your way from stone age technology to height of technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn</strong> from previous failed &quot;Quantum Gate Jumps&quot; by retaining upgrades and perks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the wealthy elite abandon a climate decimated earth, the remnants of human society focus their last hope  on their newly discovered &quot;<i>Quantum Canon</i>&quot; technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After stockpiling years of energy, they are ready to send a single augmented-human explorer to a seemingly uninhabited, distant living-world dubbed &quot;New Pangea&quot;. They hope that in this new frontier they can build the &quot;<i>Quantum Gate Terminus</i>&quot; that will allow  humanity to flee the dying Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Explorers job is simple: Without Tools or Resources, <strong>Naked</strong> and <strong>Alone</strong> (Except for your helpful ocular mounted AI companion &quot;<i>ALAI</i>&quot;):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> this new world and learn it's secrets and history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> privation and isolation of the eerily familiar planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your way from stone age technology to height of technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn</strong> from previous failed &quot;Quantum Gate Jumps&quot; by retaining upgrades and perks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Remnants of humanity send an augmented human to a seemingly uninhabited alien frontier. From sticks and stones, build the tools required to complete the Quantum Gate Terminus and save the world. A relaxed yet deep and engaging Rogue-lite Card Based Adventure; Combine, Explore, Learn &amp; Build.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366320/67d409f80883bb9fdb300b69cc31ef59c8d12c7e/header.jpg?t=1763325394", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366320/d57aca5323b467f2731e1e2b71872beec469ee9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763325394", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366320/d57aca5323b467f2731e1e2b71872beec469ee9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763325394", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window